#: ../../talk/call.rst:3
msgid "Joining a call"
msgstr "Ag dul isteach i nglao"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:6
msgid "Starting or joining a call"
msgstr "Glao a thosú nó páirt a ghlacadh ann"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:9
msgid "Browser and Talk Desktop client"
msgstr "Cliant Brabhsálaí agus Deisce Talk"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:11
msgid ""
"When you are part of a conversation and have permission to do so, you can "
"start a call at any time by clicking ``Start call`` in the top bar. When a "
"call is already in progress, join it by clicking the green ``Join call`` "
"button in the chat area or the top bar."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá tú mar chuid de chomhrá agus cead agat é sin a dhéanamh, is féidir"
" leat glao a thosú am ar bith trí chliceáil ar ``Tosaigh glao`` sa bharra "
"uachtarach. Nuair atá glao ar siúl cheana féin, téigh isteach ann trí "
"chliceáil ar an gcnaipe glas ``Glac páirt sa ghlao`` sa limistéar comhrá nó "
"sa bharra uachtarach."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:14
msgid "Talk conversation with a green Join call button"
msgstr "Comhrá le cnaipe glas ‘Bí páirteach sa ghlao’"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you have not yet given permission to the browser or the Talk Desktop "
"client to use your microphone and camera, you will be prompted to do so when"
" you click ``Start call`` or ``Join call``. Choose the microphone and camera"
" you would like to use and click ``Allow`` to grant access to your devices."
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil cead tugtha agat fós don bhrabhsálaí nó don chliant Talk Desktop"
" do mhicreafón agus do cheamara a úsáid, iarrfar ort é sin a dhéanamh nuair "
"a chliceálann tú ar \"Tosaigh glao\" nó \"Glac páirt sa ghlao\". Roghnaigh "
"an micreafón agus an ceamara ar mhaith leat a úsáid agus cliceáil ar "
"\"Ceadaigh\" chun rochtain a dheonú ar do ghléasanna."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:22
msgid ""
"You will see ``Media settings``, where you can customise your call "
"experience:"
msgstr ""
"Feicfidh tú ``Socruithe meán``, áit ar féidir leat do thaithí glaonna a "
"shaincheapadh:"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:24
msgid "Talk media settings dialog before joining a call"
msgstr "Dialóg socruithe meán gutha roimh dhul isteach i nglao"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:29 ../../talk/call.rst:172
msgid "Controlling audio and video"
msgstr "Rialú fuaime agus físe"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:31
msgid ""
"Use the microphone and camera icons at the bottom of the video preview to "
"mute or unmute your microphone and enable or disable your camera before "
"joining."
msgstr ""
"Bain úsáid as deilbhíní an mhicreafóin agus an cheamara ag bun réamhamharc "
"an fhíseáin chun do mhicreafón a mhúchadh nó a dhímhúchadh agus do cheamara "
"a chumasú nó a dhíchumasú sula dtéann tú isteach."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:33
msgid ""
"If one or both of your icons are greyed out, you either do not have a "
"microphone or camera installed, or you did not give permission to the "
"browser or Talk Desktop client to use your microphone or camera. Check that "
"you have granted permission to the browser or Talk Desktop client, and make "
"sure your microphone and camera are not in use by another application."
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil ach ceann amháin nó an dá dheilbhín liath, níl micreafón ná "
"ceamara suiteáilte agat, nó níor thug tú cead don bhrabhsálaí ná don chliant"
" Talk Desktop do mhicreafón ná do cheamara a úsáid. Seiceáil gur thug tú "
"cead don bhrabhsálaí ná don chliant Talk Desktop, agus déan cinnte nach "
"bhfuil do mhicreafón ná do cheamara in úsáid ag feidhmchlár eile."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:37
msgid ""
"Device settings allow you to choose which microphone and camera you want to "
"use. This is useful if you have more than one microphone or camera "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"Ligeann socruithe gléis duit a roghnú cén micreafón agus ceamara is mian "
"leat a úsáid. Tá sé seo úsáideach má tá níos mó ná micreafón nó ceamara "
"amháin ar fáil agat:"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:39
msgid "Talk media settings showing microphone and camera device selection"
msgstr ""
"Socruithe meán cainte a thaispeánann roghnú gléasanna micreafóin agus "
"ceamara"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:44
msgid "Noise suppression"
msgstr "Srianadh torainn"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:46
msgid ""
"Enable noise suppression to reduce background noise during calls with "
"following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Cumasaigh maolú torainn chun torann cúlra a laghdú le linn glaonna, trí na "
"céimeanna seo a leanas a leanúint:"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:48
msgid "Open ``Media settings`` before or during a call"
msgstr "Oscail ``Socruithe meán`` roimh ghlao nó le linn glao"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:49
msgid "Locate the ``Microphone settings`` section"
msgstr "Aimsigh an rannán ``Socruithe an mhicreafóin``"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:50
msgid "Enable ``Noise suppression`` at desired level"
msgstr "Cumasaigh ``Srianadh torainn`` ag an leibhéal atá ag teastáil"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:52
msgid ""
"Auto-gain control and echo cancellation options are also available in the "
"same section."
msgstr ""
"Tá roghanna maidir le rialú uathoibríoch gnóthachain agus cealú macalla ar "
"fáil sa rannán céanna freisin."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:54
msgid "Talk media settings showing microphone options"
msgstr "Socruithe meán cainte a thaispeánann roghanna micreafóin"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:59
msgid "Backgrounds"
msgstr "Cúlraí"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:61
msgid ""
"Backgrounds let you replace your video background with one of the predefined"
" images. You can also upload your own image or choose one already in "
"Nextcloud Files. Alternatively, choose the ``blur`` option to blur your live"
" video background."
msgstr ""
"Le cúlraí is féidir leat cúlra do fhíseáin a athsholáthar le ceann de na "
"híomhánna réamhshainithe. Is féidir leat d’íomhá féin a uaslódáil freisin nó"
" ceann atá i gComhaid Nextcloud cheana féin a roghnú. Nó is féidir leat an "
"rogha “doiléiriú” a roghnú chun cúlra do fhíseáin bheo a dhoiléiriú."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:65
msgid ""
"Talk media settings showing virtual background and blur options for video"
msgstr ""
"Socruithe meán Talk, ina dtaispeántar roghanna le haghaidh cúlra fíorúil "
"agus doiléiriú don fhíseán"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:70
msgid "Immediately join a call"
msgstr "Glac páirt i nglao láithreach"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:72
msgid ""
"If you wish to skip ``Media settings`` in the future, toggle the ``Skip "
"device preview before joining a call`` switch in app settings. For future "
"calls in this conversation, you will join directly, skipping the preview "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat ``Socruithe meán`` a scipeáil amach anseo, múch an lasc "
"``Seachain réamhamharc gléis sula dtéann tú isteach i nglao`` i socruithe an"
" aip. I gcás glaonna amach anseo sa chomhrá seo, glacfaidh tú páirt go "
"díreach, ag scipeáil an dialóg réamhamhairc."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:76
msgid "Record a call"
msgstr "Glao a thaifeadadh"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:78
msgid ""
"If you started the call and wish to record it, check the ``Start recording "
"immediately with the call`` checkbox. The call recording option might not be"
" available to you, depending on whether your system administrators have "
"enabled this option and whether you have ``Moderator`` permission for the "
"conversation. If you are joining and the call is being recorded, you might "
"be required to consent before being allowed to join. For more information, "
"see :ref:`Call recording <call-recording>`."
msgstr ""
"Más tusa a thosaigh an glao agus más mian leat é a thaifeadadh, seiceáil an "
"bosca seiceála ``Tosaigh ag taifeadadh láithreach leis an nglao``. B’fhéidir"
" nach mbeidh an rogha taifeadta glaonna ar fáil duit, ag brath ar cibé an "
"bhfuil an rogha seo cumasaithe ag riarthóirí do chórais agus cibé an bhfuil "
"cead ``Modhnóir`` agat don chomhrá. Má tá tú ag dul isteach agus má tá an "
"glao á thaifeadadh, b’fhéidir go mbeadh ort toiliú a thabhairt sula "
"gceadaítear duit dul isteach. Le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais, féach :ref:`Call"
" recording <call-recording>`."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:85
msgid "Start the call"
msgstr "Tosaigh an glao"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:87
msgid ""
"Click the ``Start call`` button at the bottom of ``Media settings`` to "
"notify all conversation participants of the call. If you do not want to "
"notify the other participants, start a silent call by opening the three-dot "
"menu to the left of the ``Start call`` button and choosing ``Call without "
"notification``."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil an cnaipe ``Tosaigh glao`` ag bun ``Socruithe meán`` chun fógra a "
"thabhairt do na rannpháirtithe uile sa chomhrá faoin nglao. Mura mian leat "
"fógra a thabhairt do na rannpháirtithe eile, cuir tús le glao ciúin tríd an "
"roghchlár trí phonc a oscailt ar chlé an chnaipe ``Tosaigh glao`` agus "
"``Glaoigh gan fógra`` a roghnú."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:91
msgid "Talk Call without notification option in media settings"
msgstr "Rogha 'Glao Gutha' gan fógra sna socruithe meán"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:95
msgid "Talk confirmation step for calling without sending a notification"
msgstr "Céim chun glao a dhearbhú gan fógra a sheoladh"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:99
msgid ""
"Other participants can modify notifications on a per-conversation level, "
"including whether they want to receive call notifications."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le rannpháirtithe eile fógraí a mhodhnú ar leibhéal gach comhrá, "
"lena n-áirítear an mian leo fógraí glaonna a fháil."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:101
msgid ""
"Your user status will be set to ``In a call`` and your user status icon will"
" display the speech bubble emoji."
msgstr ""
"Socrófar do stádas úsáideora go \"I nglao\" agus taispeánfar emoji boilgeog "
"cainte ar dheilbhín do stádais úsáideora."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:104
msgid "Mobile clients"
msgstr "Cliant soghluaiste"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:106
msgid ""
"When you are part of a conversation and have permission to do so, you can "
"start a call at any time by tapping the ``Phone`` or ``Video`` icon in the "
"top bar. The ``Phone`` icon starts a voice-only call; the ``Video`` icon "
"starts a video call."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá tú mar chuid de chomhrá agus cead agat é sin a dhéanamh, is féidir"
" leat glao a thosú am ar bith trí thapáil ar an deilbhín ``Fón`` nó "
"``Físeán`` sa bharra uachtarach. Tosaíonn an deilbhín ``Fón`` glao gutha "
"amháin; tosaíonn an deilbhín ``Físeán`` glao físe."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:110
msgid ""
"A voice call uses the device microphone and earpiece, like a regular phone "
"call. A video call uses the loudspeaker in hands-free mode and enables your "
"front-facing camera by default; you can disable it at any time."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann glao gutha micreafón agus cluasán an ghléis, díreach mar a "
"dhéanfadh glao gutháin rialta. Úsáideann glao físe an callaire i mód "
"saorlámha agus cuireann sé do cheamara tosaigh ar siúl de réir "
"réamhshocraithe; is féidir leat é a dhíchumasú am ar bith."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:113
msgid ""
"If someone else starts a call, you may receive a notification and your "
"device may ring or vibrate, depending on your notification settings. Tap "
"``Phone`` or ``Video`` to join, or tap the red button to decline. Declining "
"dismisses the call notification on that device."
msgstr ""
"Má thosaíonn duine eile glao, féadfaidh tú fógra a fháil agus féadfaidh do "
"ghléas glaoch nó creathadh, ag brath ar do shocruithe fógra. Tapáil \"Fón\" "
"nó \"Físeán\" chun páirt a ghlacadh, nó tapáil an cnaipe dearg chun diúltú. "
"Má dhiúltaíonn tú, cuirtear an fógra glao ar an ngléas sin ar ceal."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:117
msgid ""
"You can control your microphone and camera (if in a video call) with the "
"options shown at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat do mhicreafón agus do cheamara a rialú (más glao físe atá i "
"gceist) leis na roghanna a thaispeántar ag bun an scáileáin."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:119
msgid ""
"Your user status will be set to ``In a call`` and your user status icon will"
" display a speech bubble."
msgstr ""
"Socrófar do stádas úsáideora go \"I nglao\" agus taispeánfar boilgeog cainte"
" ar dheilbhín do stádais úsáideora."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:122
msgid "During a call"
msgstr "Le linn glao"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:124
msgid ""
"After you join a call, you will see the call view. It shows the video feeds "
"of all participants currently in the call, with additional information and "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis duit páirt a ghlacadh i nglao, feicfidh tú an radharc glaonna. "
"Taispeánann sé fothaí físe na rannpháirtithe uile atá sa ghlao faoi láthair,"
" mar aon le faisnéis agus rialuithe breise."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:126
msgid "Talk active call view showing participant video feeds"
msgstr ""
"Amharc ar ghlao gníomhach ina dtaispeántar fothaí físe na rannpháirtithe"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:130
msgid "The leftmost element shows the elapsed call time."
msgstr "Taispeánann an eilimint is faide ar chlé an t-am glaonna atá caite."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:132
msgid ""
"Next to it, you will see the number of participants that have joined the "
"current call. Clicking the number opens the right sidebar and shows the list"
" of participants. Participants that have joined the call will be listed "
"first."
msgstr ""
"In aice leis, feicfidh tú líon na rannpháirtithe atá páirteach sa ghlao "
"reatha. Trí chliceáil ar an uimhir, osclaítear an barra taoibh ar dheis agus"
" taispeánfar liosta na rannpháirtithe. Liostálfar na rannpháirtithe atá "
"páirteach sa ghlao ar dtús."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:136
msgid ""
"You will also see each participant's talking time if they have spoken during"
" the call:"
msgstr ""
"Feicfidh tú am cainte gach rannpháirtí freisin má labhair siad le linn an "
"ghlao:"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:138
msgid "Talk active call showing talking time indicator for each participant"
msgstr ""
"Glao gníomhach ina dtaispeántar táscaire ar an am cainte do gach rannpháirtí"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:142
msgid ""
"You can access additional call options and settings from the three-dot menu "
"in the top bar."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat rochtain a fháil ar roghanna agus socruithe glaonna breise ón"
" roghchlár trí phointe sa bharra barr."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:144
msgid "Talk in-call three-dot menu for additional settings and options"
msgstr ""
"Úsáid an roghchlár trí phonc le linn glaonna chun roghanna agus socruithe "
"breise a fháil"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:149
msgid "Set up breakout rooms"
msgstr "Socraigh seomraí scoite amach"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:151
msgid ""
"Breakout rooms allow you to divide a call into smaller groups for more "
"focused discussions. Depending on your permissions and how your instance is "
"configured, this option may not be available to you. For more information, "
"see :ref:`Breakout rooms <breakout-rooms>`."
msgstr ""
"Le seomraí scoite amach, is féidir leat glao a roinnt ina ghrúpaí níos lú le"
" haghaidh plé níos dírithe. Ag brath ar do cheadanna agus ar an gcaoi a "
"bhfuil do chás cumraithe, b'fhéidir nach mbeidh an rogha seo ar fáil duit. "
"Le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais, féach :ref:`Seomraí scoite amach <seomraí-"
"scoite amach>`."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:156
msgid "Download call participants list"
msgstr "Íoslódáil liosta rannpháirtithe glaonna"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:158
msgid ""
"You can download the list of participants in a call from the three-dot menu "
"in the top bar. This downloads a CSV file with the names and email addresses"
" of all participants."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat liosta na rannpháirtithe i nglao a íoslódáil ón roghchlár trí"
" phonc sa bharra uachtarach. Íoslódálann sé seo comhad CSV ina bhfuil "
"ainmneacha agus seoltaí ríomhphoist na rannpháirtithe uile."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:160
msgid "Talk in-call menu showing download participants list option"
msgstr ""
"Roghchlár le linn glao ina dtaispeántar an rogha chun liosta na "
"rannpháirtithe a íoslódáil"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:164
msgid "The CSV file contains the following columns:"
msgstr "Tá na colúin seo a leanas sa chomhad CSV:"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:166
msgid "**Name**: The name of the participant."
msgstr "**Ainm**: Ainm an rannpháirtí."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:167
msgid "**Email**: The email address of the participant."
msgstr "**Ríomhphost**: Seoladh ríomhphoist an rannpháirtí."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:168
msgid ""
"**Type**: Indicates whether the participant is a registered user or a guest."
msgstr ""
"**Cineál**: Léiríonn sé seo an úsáideoir cláraithe nó aoi an rannpháirtí."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:169
msgid "**Identifier**: Unique identifier for the participant."
msgstr "**Aitheantóir**: Aitheantóir uathúil don rannpháirtí."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:174
msgid ""
"Bottom bar of the call view offers media controls, layout settings and other"
" features you can use during a call."
msgstr ""
"Tá rialuithe meán, socruithe leagan amach agus gnéithe eile ar féidir leat a"
" úsáid le linn glao ar fáil sa bharra bun den radharc glaonna."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:176
msgid "Talk active call bottom bar showing media controls and layout settings"
msgstr ""
"Barra íochtair le linn glao gníomhaigh, ina dtaispeántar rialuithe meán agus"
" socruithe leagan amach"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:180
msgid ""
"Use the microphone and camera icons to mute/unmute your microphone and "
"enable/disable your camera. You can also use the keyboard shortcuts :kbd:`M`"
" to mute/unmute your microphone and :kbd:`V` to enable/disable your camera. "
"Use :kbd:`Space` for push-to-talk: holding space temporarily unmutes you "
"while muted, or temporarily mutes you while unmuted."
msgstr ""
"Úsáid na deilbhíní micreafóin agus ceamara chun do mhicreafón a chur ar "
"balbh nó a thógáil den balbh, agus chun do cheamara a chur ar siúl nó a "
"mhúchadh. Is féidir leat aicearraí méarchláir a úsáid freisin: :kbd:`M` chun"
" do mhicreafón a chur ar balbh nó a thógáil den balbh, agus :kbd:`V` chun do"
" cheamara a chur ar siúl nó a mhúchadh. Úsáid an eochair :kbd:`Space` (spás)"
" le haghaidh feidhm ‘brúigh-chun-labhairt’: má choinníonn tú an eochair sin "
"síos, cuirfear an balbh den mhicreafón go sealadach (má tá sé ar balbh), nó "
"cuirfear ar balbh é go sealadach (mura bhfuil sé ar balbh)."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:185
msgid "Reactions"
msgstr "Imoibrithe"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:187
msgid ""
"The reactions button lets you send an emoji reaction to all participants in "
"the call."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an cnaipe imoibrithe duit imoibriú emoji a sheoladh chuig gach "
"rannpháirtí sa ghlao."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:189
msgid "Talk active call reactions panel with emoji options"
msgstr "Painéal imoibrithe le linn glao gníomhach, le roghanna emoji"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:193
msgid ""
"Every participant will see the emoji rising from the bottom of their call "
"screen. The emoji disappears after two seconds."
msgstr ""
"Feicfidh gach rannpháirtí an emoji ag ardú ó bhun a scáileáin glaonna. "
"Imíonn an emoji tar éis dhá shoicind."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:196
msgid "Raise hand"
msgstr "Ardaigh lámh"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:198
msgid ""
"Clicking ``Raise hand`` will notify moderators and show an icon next to your"
" name. This is also available via the keyboard shortcut :kbd:`R`."
msgstr ""
"Má chliceálann tú ar “Ardaigh lámh”, cuirfear na modhnóirí ar an eolas agus "
"taispeánfar deilbhín in aice le d’ainm. Tá an rogha seo ar fáil freisin tríd"
" an aicearra méarchláir :kbd:`R`."

#: ../../talk/call.rst:201
msgid "Full screen"
msgstr "Lánscáileán"

#: ../../talk/call.rst:203
msgid ""
"Resizes your browser window or the Talk Desktop client to full-screen mode. "
"Also available via the keyboard shortcut :kbd:`F`. Press :kbd:`Esc` to "
"return to the regular view."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn sé méid fhuinneog do bhrabhsálaí nó an chliaint deisce Talk go mód"
" lánscáileáin. Tá sé ar fáil freisin tríd an aicearra méarchláir :kbd:`F`. "
"Brúigh :kbd:`Esc` chun filleadh ar an ngnáthamharc."
